DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate A250 with us by unlocking clues from the region'
 s history here at Merchants Millpond!  We have designed an escape room wit
 h a series of puzzles and riddles that lead you through the history of the
  region and NC State Parks. You will have 45 minutes to solve the clues to
  create a timeline of the area's history and secure the key to escape. Reg
 istration is required for this program. To sign up for a time please call 
 252-357-1191.  Gather your friends or family (max. 10 people) if you are u
 p for the challenge.
