DESCRIPTION:The 250th Selfie Station will be set up THIS FRIDAY at City Sta
 ge in Marion and the gazebo in Old Fort!! Starting June 26th\, these Selfi
 e Stations will be open to the public at both locations until after the Ju
 ly 4th events!!\n\nHave a little extra fun at the Fourth Friday event this
  week in Marion! Snap a commemorative photo while enjoying Fourth Fridays 
 in downtown Marion.\n\nOn Friday\, June 26\, from 6:30–9:00 PM\, live mu
 sic from JB & The 70s\, food from Mama T’s Rolling Snack Shack\, Wicked 
 Good Pretzels\, and The Scream Ice Cream\, plus drinks and downtown shoppi
 ng and dining in Marion’s social district.\n\nShare your photos using #A
 merica250 and #McDowellNC250.
GEO:35.684643;-82.009555
