DESCRIPTION:Join Us for the Jockey's Ridge Challenge!\n\nGet ready for an e
 xhilarating experience at Jockey's Ridge State Park as we proudly host the
  Jockey's Ridge Challenge! This exciting event invites participants to run
 \, walk\, or overcome a thrilling 2-mile course on the tallest natural san
 d dune system in the eastern United States.\n\n \n\nWhether you're a seaso
 ned runner seeking a "unique" challenge or a walker looking to enjoy the s
 tunning views\, this event is perfect for everyone! While the course promi
 ses a competitive atmosphere\, it also welcomes those who want to take in 
 the breathtaking scenery at a more leisurely pace.\n\n \n\nBy participatin
 g\, you'll be contributing to a worthy cause. Proceeds from the Jockey's R
 idge Challenge will benefit Friends of Jockey's Ridge\, a local non-profit
  organization dedicated to supporting\, preserving\, and enhancing Jockey'
 s Ridge State Park for future generations!\n\n \n\nTo honor our brave serv
 ice members\, they will be offering a $5 discount for Active US Military a
 nd Veterans. Join us for a day of fun\, fitness\, and community spirit at 
 Jockey's Ridge!\n\nGeneral Pricing includes:\n\n2 Mile Dunes Race (Age 17 
 & Up) $55.00\n\n2 Mile Dunes Race (Age 10-16) $30.00\n\n1 Mile Color Run $
 30.00\n\n \n\nPlease Note: On-site parking is limited\, so please carpool 
 as much as possible on race morning. A water station will be near the mid-
 point of the course. Dare County EMS will be on-call. While the exact cour
 se varies slightly from year to year based on vegetation changes\, etc\, m
 arkings and guides will be visible throughout. Strollers and pets not allo
 wed.
GEO:35.963597;-75.632255
LOCATION:Jockey's Ridge State Park
SUMMARY:Killer Dunes
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/killer-dunes
