DESCRIPTION:The Mountain Gateway Museum is having its first Pioneer Day sin
 ce Hurricane Helene. It will be on Friday\, July 3\, at 10am-4pm at 24 Wat
 er Street in Old Fort. It will have traditional Appalachian crafts\, live 
 music\, food trucks\, farm demonstrations\, children’s games\, and much 
 more. It will also coincide with the state’s “America 250 NC” celebr
 ation on the July 4th weekend. As always\, admission is free!
GEO:35.627587;-82.180647
