DESCRIPTION:Join us for our Summer Sweep volunteer series! This is a commun
 ity clean-up effort focused on giving our parks fresh and welcoming start 
 to the week after a busy summer weekend! Efforts will be focused on litter
  cleanup\, but we will also be assisting with pulling trash receptacles as
  needed. All supplies are provided. Simple effort\, serious impact! Please
  dress for the weather\, wear close-toed shoes\, and bring water!\n\n6/29/
 26: Satterwhite Point Day-Use Area\n20 Shoreline Ln\, Henderson\, NC 27537
 \n\n7/4/26: Nutbush North\, Area 1 & 2\n115 Jack Wade Farm Ln\, Henderson\
 , NC 27537\n\n7/27/26: Bullocksville Day-Use Area\n3050 Bullocksville Park
  Rd\, Manson\, 27553\n\nIf you plan to attend\, please email halle.talcott
 @ncparks.gov (preferred\, not required)!
