DESCRIPTION:Join Ranger Jackson and uncover the mysteries of Tory’s Den
 —where legend and story variation collide. Participants will hike from t
 he parking lot to the cave which is roughly .4 miles total. Please make su
 re to bring water and wear proper hiking attire. Following this event at 1
 0:30 a.m. will be a guided tour of the Rock House at 1041 Colonel Jack Mar
 tin Road led by the Stokes County Historical Society. Sign up is not requi
 red but helpful\, please contact Jackson.perry@ncparks.gov for additional 
 information.
GEO:36.401868;-80.299545
