DTEND:20260704T160000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us on the lawn of the Historic Camden County Courthouse to
  celebrate 250 years of Independence! Festivities will kick off at 10am wi
 th a community Flag Raising\, Reading of the Declaration of Independence a
 nd National Anthem\, performed by Doc Perkins.  Come out and enjoy tours o
 f the Camden County Heritage Museum & Historic Jail\, Patriotic Art Activi
 ties\, colonial toys and FREE 250th swag! We Got the Scoop Ice Cream truck
  will be selling ice cream to cool off.
GEO:36.330516;-76.177287
LOCATION:Camden County Historic Courthouse\, Lawn
SUMMARY:Camden County Independence Day Celebration!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/camden-county-independence-d
 ay-celebration
