DESCRIPTION:Part of Edenton's 4th of July Celebration\, please come help ce
 lebrate America's 250th Birthday on the water! Sponsored by Harbor Towns\,
  Inc\, and benefitting the Edenton-Chowan Optimist Club 4th of July Celebr
 ation. Show your American pride in our 'Anything Non-Motorized that Floats
 ' Patriotic Costume Parade! There will be a grand prize for the winner(s)\
 , a private chartered cruise on the Albemarle Queen! (Valued at $2\,000.00
 ) Extra points will be awarded for 1776 and Revolutionary Themes\, as well
  as for the Edenton Tea Party - Colonial Women. The Edenton Yacht Club is 
 providing maritime support.  \n\nEdenton's 4th of July Celebration: \n\nJo
 in us as we celebrate Independence Day...the Edenton way! Let the firework
 s fly! Come to downtown Edenton at Colonial Waterfront Park and celebrate 
 the 250th anniversary of our country. Visit local vendors\, get food downt
 own\, and in the evening\, enjoy incredible fireworks with friends and fam
 ily. All-day event - 9:00 am to 9:00 pm\n\nWhen is the Event? \n\nSaturday
 \, July 4\, 2026 - 9:00 am to 9:30 pm - floating parade time 2:00 pm - 4:0
 0 pm\n\nWhere is the event?\n\nColonial Waterfront Park\, 510 S Broad Stre
 et\, Edenton\, NC\n\nFor More Information: 844-IBX-BOAT\n\nEmail info@harb
 ortowns.org for registration and regulations
