  is the highlight of the summer! Thousands of attendees from all walks of 
 life come together for live music\, foods for every taste\, and a spectacu
 lar fireworks display. Attendees leave the event with nostalgia of an old 
 fashioned Independence Day celebration and pride for their community. In 2
 026\, America is celebrating its 250th birthday and the Freedom Festival w
 ill celebrate this monumental occasion. \n\nThis year's event will take pl
 ace on July 4th at Onslow Pines Park from 3-9PM. Join us for an unforgetta
 ble evening of music\, food trucks and fireworks. Open to the public\, no 
 registration required.
