DTSTAMP:20260731T040425Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52399654045689
DTSTART:20260705T012000Z
DTEND:20260705T015000Z
DESCRIPTION:Fireworks are a classic symbol of independence and celebration.
  The event visually represents the ideals of liberty and the excitement of
  freedom\, allowing the community to reflect on America’s history and va
 lues in a shared\, awe-inspiring experience. The Fourth of July Fireworks 
 bring the community together to commemorate the nation’s founding\, crea
 ting a shared moment of celebration that honors American heritage. In the 
 context of America’s 250\, the fireworks highlight 250 years of independ
 ence and the enduring spirit of freedom\, patriotism\, and unity that have
  shaped the nation.\n\n \n\nLearn more: https://nagsheadnc.gov/614/Events\
 n\n \n\nQuestions? Contact Katie Anzalone\, Town of Nags Head Deputy Town 
 Clerk\, at katie.anzalone@nagsheadnc.gov or (252) 449-2021.
GEO:35.973164;-75.63158
LOCATION:Nags Head
SUMMARY:Nags Head: Fourth of July Fireworks Show
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/nags-head-fourth-of-july-fir
 eworks-show
