DESCRIPTION:Have you seen animal tracks and wondered what the critter was t
 hinking and doing? Sometimes\, their tracks can give you a pretty good ide
 a! We will be doing a short-guided hike (just under half a mile) to interp
 ret the tracks we come across. Afterwards\, we will play a game! This prog
 ram is suitable for all ages\, adults and kids are all encouraged to parti
 cipate! We'll be meeting next to the visitor center at 10am.
GEO:35.2024;-78.976116
