 ieutenant Colonel\, last stationed at Fort Monroe. He now serves on the Bo
 ard of Directors for the American Friends of Lafayette. He was also Co-cha
 ir with Mrs. Womble of Suffolk events celebrating the 200th anniversary of
  Lafayette’s visit to Suffolk. Mr. and Mrs. Womble were part of the rece
 ption given to Lafayette when he arrived at New York and the send-off when
  he departed Washington\, D.C.
