  movements\, can help reduce visceral fat. The first 5–10 minutes will f
 ocus on stretching and warming up our muscle groups. This will be followed
  by 10 minutes of movement practice\, leading into a 20-minute AMRAP (As M
 any Rounds/Reps As Possible) circuit. We’ll finish with a 10-minute cool
