DESCRIPTION:What about Tropical Storm Chantal's weather and Eno River's top
 ography contributed to the most recent\, record breaking\, flood event? If
  this question has been buzzing around in your head since the storm\, join
  a Ranger for a presentation (with photos) followed by a hike. Come on and
  sign up for your question to be answered.\n\nAll children must be accompa
 nied by an adult. Please be sure to dress appropriately for the weather\, 
 wear hiking shoes\, and bring water!\n\nSpaces are limited\, and registrat
 ion is required. To sign up\, call (984) 250-1370 or email eno.river@ncpar
