DESCRIPTION:Step back in time and celebrate our nation’s 250th anniversar
 y at Jordan’s Cabin (211 E Decatur St Madison\, NC)! Join us on Saturday
 \, July 11\, from 1:00–3:00 PM for an afternoon of history\, music\, and
  family fun at one of Madison’s most treasured landmarks.\n\nEnjoy:\n-Re
 volutionary-era dancers\n-Live music by the Christal Creek Band (bring a l
 awn chair)\n-Reenactors in period attire\n-Murphy Street Girls Lemonade\n-
 Historical exhibits and information tables\n\nWhether you’re a lifelong 
