DESCRIPTION:Its that time of year again! Come celebrate the summer at Merch
 ants Millpond State Park with our 4th year of the Summer Junior Adventure 
 Series! In this series\, we have a different topic that we teach about eve
 ry Monday at 10 AM throughout the summer. \n\nJoin us at the Millpond for 
 this week's topic\; amphibians! Whether on land or in the water\, these cr
 eatures play a special in their ecosystem. Come visit us as take a closer 
 look at these special little critters. \n\nThis program will start promptl
 y at 10 AM at the visitor center. Guests are encouraged to dress for the w
 eather as part of this program will be outside.
