DESCRIPTION:Climb aboard for a guided cruise through the rich estuarine hab
 itats surrounding Hammocks Beach State Park. This ranger-led adventure wil
 l explore the plants\, animals\, and natural processes that make our coast
 al ecosystems so unique. Keep an eye out for birds\, dolphins\, crabs\, an
 d other wildlife as we discuss the importance of estuaries and their role 
 in supporting life along the North Carolina coast. Limited to 11 participa
 nts\; sign-up is required. Contact the park to register at 910-326-4881.
