DESCRIPTION:Have you heard of the Tory War? From 1780-81\, Cumberland Count
 y and the surrounding region fell into a civil war between Tories and Patr
 iots during the American Revolution. Learn the stories of courage and horr
 or that took place in this formative period in the region's history! \n\nT
 his project was produced with assistance from the America 250 North Caroli
 na initiative\, administered by the North Carolina Department of Natural a
 nd Cultural Resources. Any opinions\, findings and conclusions or recommen
 dations expressed in this material are those of the author(s) and do not n
 ecessarily reflect the views of the State of North Carolina.
