DESCRIPTION:Kitt Kittredge: An American Girl (2008) - Kit Kittredge\, a gir
 l growing up in Depression-era Cincinnati\, has a nose for news and a knac
 k for picking up strays. When a crime spree hits the Ohio city\, all evide
 nce points to the local hobo community\, particularly Kit's friend Will. S
 he recruits her friends Ruthie and Stirling to sniff out the real thief\, 
 but the children uncover a plot that reaches far beyond Cincinnati.\n\nBri
 ng your doll or a stuffy to enjoy a movie American Girl style and they'll 
 receive a special treat from the concession stand!
