DESCRIPTION:Its that time of year again! Come celebrate the summer at Merch
 ants Millpond State Park with our 4th year of the Summer Junior Adventure 
 Series! In this series\, we have a different topic that we teach about eve
 ry Monday at 10 AM throughout the summer. \n\nCome soak up the summer sun 
 with this week's theme\; reptiles! Ranger Joe will be coming down to tell 
 us abou all the things that make reptiles unique and special. From tiny tu
 rtles to large alligators\, reptiles come in all shapes and size\, which i
 s one of the reasons we're glad to have them around the Millpond. Come lea
 rn about some our favorites!\n\nThis program will start promptly at 10 AM 
 at the visitor center. Guests are encouraged to dress for the weather as p
 art of this program may be outside.
