DESCRIPTION:Gobble gobble! That's turkey for "Come learn about one of Ameri
 ca's most iconic birds!". Our local rangers will talk about the characteri
 stics and adaptions that make the turkey a special animal in Chimney Rock 
 State Park. Participants will also be able to craft their own turkey call 
 device to take home with them.\n\n**This event is free with paid admission
  to the Chimney Rock Attraction.**
