DESCRIPTION:Bring your lunch and a chair\, and meet us under the picnic she
 lter to learn all about Rendezvous Mountain\, from its roots in the Revolu
 tionary War to tomorrow!\n\nStep into the story of Rendezvous Mountain\, a
  place where history\, nature\, and community come together. Nestled in no
 rthwestern Wilkes County\, the mountain's legacy stretches back to the Rev
 olutionary War. Join Park Superintendent Jeff Matheson as he brings its fa
 scinating past to life\, shares updates on the park today\, and offers a l
 ook at the future of this unique public land.\n\nThis is a free event with
  the exception of an optional tour of the historic home of William Lenoir\
 , which will be offered after the lunch and learn event. Admission for a h
 ouse tour is $7/adults and $5/children aged 5-14 years old.
GEO:36.017207;-81.494497
