DESCRIPTION:Around the globe\, park rangers are on the front line in the fi
 ght to protect our natural heritage. World Ranger Day offers a chance to s
 upport their vital work\, which ranges from environmental campaigning to e
 ducation. The date\, July 31st every year is also an opportunity to pay tr
 ibute to rangers who have lost their lives in the line of duty.\n\nHonor a
 nd understand the duties of your North Carolina state park rangers by read
 ing a storywalk of What a Ranger Does by Joseph Hiatt along the Great Wood
 land Adventure Trail.\n\n***This event is free with paid admission to the 
