DESCRIPTION:Join Ranger Gracie to learn about common snakes you might see i
 n the park. Learn how snakes survive\, hunt\, and help keep ecosystems hea
 lthy. Examine snake skins\, skulls\, and other materials while separating 
 snake facts from snake myths. Perfect for all ages!
GEO:36.342384;-80.463541
LOCATION:Pilot Mountain State Park
SUMMARY:The Truth About Snakes
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/the-truth-about-snakes
