DESCRIPTION:Join us as we celebrate World Ranger Day! Our Park Rangers work
  hard to keep our parks and public lands open\, safe\, and accessible for 
 all. Did you know that many rangers are also firefighters\, EMTs\, police 
 officers\, and more? Meet a Park Ranger and learn about the many hats a Pa
 rk Ranger wears. \n\nThis touch-a-truck style program will give you a hand
 s-on look at the gear\, training\, and daily work that goes into protectin
 g the Park.\n\nAround the globe\, park rangers are on the front line in th
 e fight to protect our natural heritage. World Ranger Day offers a chance 
 to support their vital work\, which ranges from environmental campaigning 
 to education. The day is also an opportunity to pay tribute to rangers who
  have lost their lives in the line of duty.\n\n***Free with Admission to C
 himney Rock Attraction***
