DTEND:20260801T210000Z
DESCRIPTION:Immerse yourself in a vibrant\, fully bilingual experience (Spa
 nish-English) that’s a fusion of science\, culture and innovation.\n\nEn
 gage with scientists across both Museum buildings\, offering dozens of han
 ds-on activities and interactive exhibits designed to highlight the richne
 ss of Hispanic heritage\, alongside traditional music\, storytelling\, art
  and dance.\n\nIt’s an event that’s free and open to the public\, with
  something for everyone from science enthusiasts to curious learners. Join
  us as we come together to celebrate diversity and community!
GEO:35.782156;-78.639336
LOCATION:North Carolina Museum of Natural Sciences
SUMMARY:Día de la Ciencia y la Cultura
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/dia-de-la-ciencia-y-la-cultu
 ra
