DESCRIPTION:¡Hola! Come join Ranger Billiet on a scavenger hunt hike to le
 arn Spanish vocabulary about nature! Knowledge of the Spanish language is 
 not required and\, while the words\, we’ll be learning are beginner-leve
 l\, friends of all ages can join! We’ll meet at the Secret Pond before w
 e embark on a half-mile hike to learn new words. Wear proper hiking attire
  and bring water!
GEO:35.202406;-78.976115
LOCATION:Carvers Creek State Park – Long Valley Farm Access
SUMMARY:Las Palabras de Naturaleza
