DESCRIPTION:Join us for the ENO ARTS MILL GRAND REOPENING Friday\, August 7
 \, 6-9pm.  Featuring:\n\nLive music with Chapel Hill’s own\, Liquid Plea
 sureOpen artist studios with the Eno Arts Mill Studio ArtistsLocal food tr
 ucksBeer\, wine\, and NA beer selectionsFree art-making activities for all
  ages with Mer HaggertyIN THE GALLERY - CHRYSALIS: RESILIANCE | RENEWAL | 
 TRANSFORMATION\, A reunion of Eno Arts Mill Studio Artists Impacted by Tro
