 ld\, abandoned cabin? Would you like to know its history? You’re in luck
 ! Hike 2.0 miles with a Ranger to the Anthony Cole Homestead off the Buckq
 uarter Creek Trail to learn about this ruin inside the park.\n\nAll childr
 en must be accompanied by an adult. Please be sure to dress appropriately 
 for the weather\, wear hiking shoes\, and bring water!\n\nSpaces are limit
 ed\, and registration is required. To sign up\, call (984) 250-1370 or ema
 il eno.river@ncparks.gov. Include the number of guests in your party and a
