DESCRIPTION:Join JR Shanty Co for a performance of original and classic sea
  shanties and songs of the sea.\n\nJulianne Laird and Richard Laird are ma
 rried and retired music teachers. Julianne has had a life-long interest in
  and fascination with the history and legends of the Outer Banks. Richard 
 is an avid sailor so it was a natural fit to combine their love of music\,
  sailing\, and the Outer Banks into J.R. Shanty Co.  \n\nThe presentation 
 is part of the museum’s Salty Dawg Speaker Series\, which features prese
 ntations on North Carolina maritime history and culture. The series is fre
 e and open to the public and is sponsored by the Friends of the Graveyard 
 of the Atlantic Museum. Reservations are not required. Call 252-986-0720 f
 or more information.
