DESCRIPTION:Every year\, Earth travels through a debris field left behind b
 y a Sun-orbiting comet resulting in amazing meteor showers that light up t
 he pre-dawn July and August skies. Join a Ranger to learn about these and 
 other fiery space objects and then enjoy the show! \n\nLeave when you need
  to! \n\nBring a chair or blanket as the best viewing will be lying down! 
 All children must be accompanied by an adult. Please be sure to dress appr
 opriately for the weather\, wear bug spray\, bring water and snacks! \n\nS
 paces are limited\, and registration is required. To sign up\, call (984) 
 250-1370 or email eno.river@ncparks.gov. Include the number of guests in y
 our party and a phone number where you can be reached if the event is chan
 ged or canceled.
GEO:36.078519;-79.005129
LOCATION:Eno River State Park - Fews Ford Access & Visitor Center\, Loop Pa
 rking Lot (End of the Road)
SUMMARY:Summer Meteor Shower: Perseids
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/summer-meteor-shower-perseid
 s
CATEGORIES:Education Programs
END:VEVENT
