DESCRIPTION:Get to know the plants in our backyard and explore the landscap
 e of Vance Birthplace on this guided outdoor tour! Walk the grounds with o
 ur staff on Saturday\, August 22 as we highlight plants that shaped daily 
 life in Western North Carolina.\n\nDuring this program\, you’ll learn ho
 w people in the 1800s used native and naturalized plants for food\, work\,
  home care\, and remedies. Join us to connect with the plants that have ch
 aracterized our landscape for hundreds of years!\n\nThis specialty guided 
 tour will last for approximately 90 minutes and tickets cost $10.70 per pe
 rson. Tours are offered at 10 AM and 1 PM. Spots are limited\, so we recom
 mend registering in advance. Register online at Zeffy\, over the phone at 
 (828) 645-6706\, or in-person at Vance Birthplace!
