DESCRIPTION:The Complete History of America (Abridged)\nSunday\, August 30\
 , 2026 | 3:00 PM\nMcGregor Hall Performing Arts Center | Henderson\, NC\n\
 nWhat better way to celebrate the 250th birthday of our country than to en
 joy a lighthearted review of the history of these United States! 600 years
  of history in 6\,000 seconds! From Washington to Watergate\, yea verily f
 rom the Bering Straits to Baghdad\, from New World to New World Order – 
 The Complete History of America (Abridged) is a 90-minute rollercoaster ri
 de through the glorious quagmire that is American History\, reminding us t
 hat it’s not the length of your history that matters — it’s what you
 ’ve done with it! You don’t want to miss this hysterically funny show!
 \n\nPerformances:\nFriday\, August 28 - 7:30 PM\nSaturday\, August 29 - 7:
 30 PM\nSunday\, August 30 - 3:00PM \n\nFor tickets and information\, visit
  mcgregorhall.org.\n\nPresented by McGregor Hall in partnership with Vance
  County America 250.
GEO:36.327154;-78.404751
LOCATION:McGregor Hall Performing Arts Center
SUMMARY:Vance America 250: The Complete History of America (Abridged) - A M
 usical at McGregor Hall
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/vance-america-250-the-comple
 te-history-of-america-abridged-a-musical-at-mcgregor-hall-4573
CATEGORIES:Performances & Arts
CATEGORIES:Theater & Musicals
END:VEVENT
