 om $25 to $40 with discounts available for active military\, Lee County ed
 ucators and students\, and groups of 10 or more. Visit templeshows.org or 
 call 919-774-4512 for more information.
GEO:35.48114;-79.178793
LOCATION:Temple Theatre
SUMMARY:Temple Theatre Presents: "1776: An American Musical"
