DESCRIPTION:This Town wide festival will honor Stovall's most famous reside
 nt and signer of the Declaration of Indepencence\, John Penn.  The festiva
 l will feature two live John Penn reenactments at 12 p.m. and 2:00 p.m.  p
 lus his grand entrance on a horse drawn carriage down Main St. in Stovall.
   There will be a Stovall Car Cruise-In\, raffles\, pie in the face\, and 
 a Kid Zone includes a variety of kid games\, face paint\, bounce houses.\n
 \nThis festival also includes an amazing line up of vendors of all varieti
 es (30+) and food trucks of all varieties (6).  The event is FREE to the p
 ublic.
GEO:36.447344;-78.56911
LOCATION:Stovall\, North Carolina
SUMMARY:Stovall Harvest Festival -- A John Penn Celebration
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/stovall-harvest-festival-a-j
 ohn-penn-celebration-5113
