DESCRIPTION:BOO! EEEEKKKK! It's spooky season yet again! \n\nUsing our flas
 hlights\, we will search through the woods to find hidden nocturnal animal
 s and listen for the creepy sounds that they make at night. Costumes are w
 elcome and candy will be handed out at the end of the hike. \n\nThis hike 
 can be selfled or a Ranger led hike will begin at 6:30 pm.
GEO:35.648906;-80.944644
LOCATION:Lake Norman State Park- Lakeshore Trailhead 
SUMMARY:LANO's Slightly Haunted Hik
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/lanos-slightly-haunted-hik
END:VEVENT
