DESCRIPTION:The High Country is filled with ghost stories and unexplained e
 ncounters. What stories have you been told? Come carve some Jack-o-Lantern
 s and share some spooky high country stories with us. This program will be
  at The Park at Seven Devils. This is a Ranger Workshop with The Town of S
 even Devils. Limited spots\, please email amelia.gallina@ncparks.gov to re
 gister by October 22nd.
GEO:36.14599;-81.797599
LOCATION:The Park at Seven Devils
SUMMARY:Ranger Workshop - Haunted High Country
