DESCRIPTION:Dive into a variety of STEAM displays and demonstrations across
  the site. The highlight of the day is a unique opportunity to step into t
 he shoes of historic miners as you explore 450 feet of restored tunnels\, 
 50 feet below the surface\, in our underground mine.\n\nAdmission is $4.00
  (plus tax) for ages 5 and up and children under 5 are free of charge. Cas
 h and credit card payments inside the Visitor Center (we cannot accept Ame
 rican Express).\n\nGold panning will be offered\, weather permitting\, for
  an additional $4.00 per person (plus tax). \n\nRegistration is not accept
 ed for Homeschool Day.
