DESCRIPTION:Join us as we celebrate Native American Heritage Month with his
 toric foodways! Our costumed interpreters will cook dishes and discuss his
 toric methods of native cooking. Food samples are unavailable to the publi
 c. Demonstration only. FREE. All ages welcome. Drop-in.
GEO:35.979741;-79.992174
LOCATION:High Point Museum
SUMMARY:Indigenous Cooking in the Historical Park
