DESCRIPTION:Become more Bear Wise and learn all about black bears physical 
 features\, behavioral patterns\, and how they change with age. We will als
 o learn about prevention methods for both backcountry and rural settings\,
  alongside what to do if you encounter a bear in either setting. The Black
  Bear program will be held at The Seven Devils Community Center as part of
  their Ranger Workshop Series.
